message: "Please use the organizational citation identity below."
title: "Attainment of the chain Young metric on rational step words"
authors:
  - name: DannyExperiments
type: article
repository-code: "https://github.com/DannyExperiments/chain-young-metric-attainment"
abstract: "The fixed-length chain Young metric on rational step words has an attaining finite chain when distances between source and target letters are rational. A run-transport formulation includes a quadratic inversion cost."
keywords:
  - chain Young metric
  - rational step words
  - quadratic-form optimal transport
  - attainment
